OL,3,GNEWSAExpelled university student jailed
OL,4,Afor bomb hoaxes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former student expelled by a
OL,7,Funiversity has been jailed for two
OL,8,Fyears after he falsely said bombs had
OL,9,Fbeen planted at one of its sites.
OL,11,FMuzammil Ayyaz, 31, called the
OL,12,FUniversity of Reading twice in
OL,13,FSeptember 2023 and said there were
OL,14,Fbombs on its Whiteknights campus.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended and no
OL,16,Fbombs were found.
OL,18,FAyyaz, from Feltham, London, was
OL,19,Fexpelled in March 2023 and between June
OL,20,Fand September that year made more than
OL,21,F800 threatening calls to the
OL,22,Finstitution across 17 different days.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
